#: includes/admin.php:350
msgid ""
"Run this command on the server as the site's PHP-FPM user (not as root), "
"e.g. via SSH. It writes the complete file with all values Tegatai knows "
"right now, including values still stored in the database by an older "
"version; those database copies are deleted automatically afterwards. Edit "
"the commented lines in the file to add more secrets."
msgstr ""
"Run this command on the server as the site's PHP-FPM user (not as root), "
"e.g. via SSH. It writes the complete file with all values Tegatai knows "
"right now, including values still stored in the database by an older "
"version; those database copies are deleted automatically afterwards. Edit "
"the commented lines in the file to add more secrets."

